| `layers.frontend.journey.port` | integer | `4391` | an integer from 1 to 65535 that no other process holds | `src/frontend/<stack>/playwright.config.ts` (`make test-fe-e2e`) | Moves the port the journey's preview server binds; a port another process already holds fails the journey rather than testing that server, and a missing or non-integer value fails it as its config loads, naming the key. | the dev server (`make run-web`) or the REST API (`make run-api`), which do not read it | when `frontend_stack` is not `none` |
